This directory is a copy of github.com/d-fuji/jpeg2000, a pure Go JPEG 2000
decoder, at module version v0.0.0-20260723165233-0971f6693ff9, distributed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE in this directory).

Changes made in blunderDB:

- package renamed j2k; the init that registered the "jp2" and "jpc" formats
  with package image, DecodeConfig and MaxImagePixels removed;
- Parse and Image.Decode replace Decode: the parser checks, in its single
  pass over the headers, the bounds the jpx package documents (components,
  pixels, tiles, tile-parts, precinct and code-block sizes, high-throughput
  JPEG 2000, JP2 palette and channel boxes, marker order and lengths);
- decoding checks a context between packets and between code-blocks;
- the tests read the library's reference images through Parse.
